  "question": {
    "text": "The equation of a tangent to the parabola $y^2=8 x$ is $y=x+2$. The point on this line from which the other tangent to the parabola is perpendicular to the given tangent is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "\n$(-1,1)$\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$(0,2)$\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$(2,4)$\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n$(-2,0)$",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Point must be on the directrix of the parabola. \nHence the point is $(-2,0)$."
  }
}